          "value": "<p>Choose the breath weapon from the \"Hydra Breath Weapon\" list.\n\nHydra Breath Weapon. - Rolling Bile {@recharge 5}. The hydra spews a ball of putrid bile at a point within 20 feet from it. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a DC 14 Dexterity saving throw taking 21 (6d6) poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\n- Crackling Thunder {@recharge 5}. The hydra spews bolts of lighting in a 15-foot cone. Every creature must succeed against a DC 14 Dexterity saving throw or take 18 (4d8) lightning damage and it cannot use its reactions until the start of hydra's next turn.\n- Ball of Fire {@recharge 5}. The hydra spews a large ball of fire at a point within 15 feet from it. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a DC 14 Dexterity saving throw taking 14 (4d6) fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The fire spreads around corners. It lasts for 10 minute. When a creature enters the burning area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, takes 3 (1d6) fire damage.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
